  "content": [
   {
    "_key": "eb42ba4a0292",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "aa18a85e25950",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "This is the privacy notice of Uniqletts Limited (registration number: 07055697), whose registered office is at 167 Latymer Court, Hammersmith Road, London W6 7JQ."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "9e51f08b2a58",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "03f89b1419f20",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "This privacy notice sets out how we collect and process your personal data. This privacy notice also provides certain information that is legally required and lists your rights in relation to your personal data."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "563a1419190b",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "14902b1d63e50",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "This privacy notice relates to personal information that identifies you as a natural person (whether you are an actual or potential customer, an individual who browses our website or an individual outside our organisation with whom we interact). We refer to this information throughout this privacy notice and policy as personal data or personal information and further detail of what this includes are set out in this privacy notice below."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "6d89b68208af",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "974f11c410d50",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The privacy and security of your personal information is very important to us so we want to assure you that your information will be properly managed and protected by us at all times. Please read this privacy notice carefully as it explains how we may collect and use your personal data."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "eb96941b7621",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "a45bcdc08ec60",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "CHANGES TO THE PRIVACY NOTICE AND YOUR DUTY TO INFORM US OF CHANGES"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "c4db5d2fd988",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "d96d786d0d090",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "This privacy notice may vary from time to time so please check it regularly. This version was last updated on 25 May 2018."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "c152c777768d",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "2addcaa0d3520",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "It is important that the personal data we hold about you is accurate and current. Please keep us informed if your personal data changes during your relationship with us. For example if you change your email address, name or payment details, please let us know the correct details by sending a letter to us at our registered address above. You may ask us, or we may ask you, to correct information you or we think is inaccurate, and you may also ask us to remove information which is inaccurate."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "fafeb633a69a",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "8db59ff4cdf00",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "LINKS TO OTHER WEBSITES"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "17ac22013f47",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "f6553a6b1c080",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Our website may contain links to other websites of interest. However, once you have used these links to leave our site, you should note that we do not have any control over that other website. Therefore, we cannot be responsible for the protection and privacy of any information which you provide whilst visiting such sites and such sites are not governed by this privacy notice. You should exercise caution and look at the privacy statement applicable to the website in question."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "6b77c47d340c",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "145a3f1388320",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "HOW TO CONTACT US"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "e830064c86d4",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "4ca50258d8840",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "For the purposes of relevant data protection legislation, we are a controller of your personal data. As a controller we use (or process) the personal data we hold about you in accordance with this privacy notice."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "01b2dc3b9d1e",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "398be9f0d4f80",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "If you need to contact us in connection with the use or processing of your personal data, then you can do so using our contact details on our website or correspondence you may have received from us."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "a8d2329635f2",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "48dc5e6795010",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "WHAT INFORMATION WE HOLD ABOUT YOU?"
