     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "46b525fcb697",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "17a90eceb06b0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "In the interests of security and to improve our service, telephone calls you make to us may be monitored and/ or recorded."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "8bb1e52f49b0",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "1f4b0fdbc7b40",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The processing is necessary to pursue our legitimate interest in the management and operation of our business."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "15fde98dfc3b",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "b2f3ba6858c40",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "COOKIES"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "78bea0af4d28",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "7df189d3aec00",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "A cookie is a small file which asks permission to be placed on your computer's hard drive."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "4c72f57453c3",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "ca4a6c3e6da80",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Once you agree, the file is added and the cookie helps analyse web traffic or lets you know when you visit a particular site."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "a0c3382299a4",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "233ab9cb3d300",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Cookies allow web applications to respond to you as an individual."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "8b6c2b64d47d",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "c309e980ac190",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The web application can tailor its operations to your needs, likes and dislikes by gathering and remembering information about your preferences."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "f6e41794504b",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "d6bead8a36430",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "This may help us analyse data about web page traffic and improve our website in order to tailor it to customer needs."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "f7594eef5618",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "2728d82ba9f20",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "We only use this information for statistical analysis purposes and then the data is removed from the system."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "63d377d592f3",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "4482c47420430",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Overall, cookies help us provide you with a better website, by enabling us to monitor which pages you find useful and which you do not."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "3b0a9a30ab64",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "3e1dde0a8fd40",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "A cookie in no way gives us access to your computer or any information about you, other than the data you choose to share with us. You can choose to accept or decline cookies. Most web browsers automatically accept cookies, but you can usually modify your browser setting to decline cookies if you prefer. This may prevent you from taking full advantage of the website."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "43f4c12eeaf9",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "5a1caa0603590",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "WHO WE PASS YOUR PERSONAL DATA TO"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "b945b2900791",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "4e55187459640",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "We may have to share your personal data with the parties set out below for the purposes set out in the table above."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "2d17a1a9ff05",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "12e365f366ac0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Service providers acting as processors who provide IT and system administration services including Trace Property Solutions."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "3eef615885e4",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "6cabcdfb6da20",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Property related services such as contractors tradespersons or service providers acting as processors in providing maintenance and management services."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "1787a04379b8",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "f5488f81e75d0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Professional advisers acting as processors or joint controllers including lawyers, auditors, debt collection agencies and insurers who provide consultancy, banking, legal, insurance and accounting services."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "8d52ca34ff03",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "f863f23fe7930",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "HM Revenue & Customs, regulators and other authorities acting as processors or joint controllers based in the United Kingdom who require reporting of processing activities in certain circumstances."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "85a5966769ff",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "241207dc99280",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "We require all third parties to respect the security of your personal data and to treat it in accordance with the law. We do not allow our third‐party service providers to use your personal data for their own purposes and only permit them to process your personal data for specified purposes and in accordance with our instructions."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "9ca8472eb55b",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "1abf90f17b2a0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "HOW IS YOUR DATA SECURED"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "27e475f4ad51",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "710639e7e8b00",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "We have put in place appropriate security measures to prevent your personal data from being accidentally lost, used or accessed in an unauthorised way, altered or disclosed. In addition, we limit access to your personal data to those employees, agents, contractors and other third parties who will only process your personal data on our instructions and they are subject to a duty of confidentiality."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "a087fd0063c9",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "69389eaf9e350",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "We have put in place procedures to deal with any suspected personal data breach and will notify you and any applicable regulator of a breach where we are legally required to do so."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "ad37dd31af6b",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "267f7e5eb6190",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "HOW LONG WILL WE USE YOUR PERSONAL DATA FOR"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "46b4a52df381",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "6bfb44315ecf0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "We will only store your data for as long as is necessary to fulfill the purposes we collected it for, including for the purposes of satisfying any legal, accounting, or reporting requirements."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "b5aa1652fd13",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "a5e1d3052a5d0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "YOUR RIGHTS"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "187b46d00351",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "2da17518920b0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "You have a number of rights concerning the personal information we use, which you may ask us to observe. In some cases even when you make a request concerning your personal information, we may not be required, or be able to carry out your request as this may result in us not being able to fulfil our legal and regulatory obligations under the lawful processing conditions under which we hold your data or because there is a minimum statutory period of time for which we have to keep you information."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "61f8377f58cb",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "e88dd0acf6770",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "You can ask us to:"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "52d32d4e8cf5",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "8b754793aaba0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Provide a copy of your personal information."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "9c71a6873b0b",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "d9e86f614d230",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Correct or delete unnecessary or inaccurate personal information."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "b1555054ac07",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "4dd50f0a5a0d0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Restrict or to object to the use of your personal information at any time."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "b864a1fa8728",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "78433219853e0",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Provide your personal data in a structured, commonly used and machine‐readable format and to have your personal data transferred to another controller. This right only applies where our processing of your personal data is automated and the processing took place initially with your consent or for the performance of a contract with you."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "3bb726ab8d6b",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "d7514776a7140",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "If and where we rely on your consent to use your personal information, you can withdraw that consent at any time. Where your consent is withdrawn, your previous consent will remain valid in respect of our use of your information prior to the date you withdrew it."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "3639b98ba590",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "ca05981755780",
